OL,3,AMan charged with causing death by
OL,4,Adangerous driving over crash that
OL,5,Akilled 6
OL,6,
OL,7,FA man has been charged with causing
OL,8,Fdeath by dangerous driving over a crash
OL,9,Fthat killed six people, including two
OL,10,Fchildren.
OL,12,FShannen Morgan and Shane Roller died
OL,13,Falong with two of their daughters,
OL,14,Fnine-year-old Rubie, and Lillie, four,
OL,15,Fwhen the family's car collided with a
OL,16,Fmotorbike on the A61 between Barnsley
OL,17,Fand Wakefield on 21 July 2024.
OL,19,FHusband and wife Christopher and Janine
OL,20,FBarton, from Barnsley, who were both
OL,21,Ftravelling on the motorcycle, also died
OL,22,Fin the crash.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
